# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets out of it.
# A file that never enters the context cannot end up in an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.git/
.github/
docs/
tests/
db/
scripts/
infra/
*.md
# ...except the one the workspace root pyproject declares as its readme.
# Excluding it makes the build fail at metadata parse time, some distance from
# the line that actually caused it.
!README.md
